            }
          ],
          "effect": "underlayment_class_a_classification_not_required"
        }
      ],
      "evidence_required": [
        "Roofing detail/section showing 72 lb cap sheet to ASTM D3909, or noncombustible separator",
        "Bird stop product cut sheet and installation note at eaves",
        "Spec note that hip and ridge caps are mudded in",
        "Class A underlayment listing if alternate method used"
      ],
      "depends_on": [
